Add ir metadata to an existing script

Usage: ir init [OPTIONS] --script <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Existing R script to modify in place

Options:
      --script      Initialize a standalone R script
      --no-project  Do not use a renv.lock discovered above the script
  -h, --help        Print help

Examples:
  ir init --script analysis.R
  ir init --script analysis.R --no-project
